description	"Weequay

^2Weaponry:
- Bowcaster (1)
- 2 Concussion Grenades
- 1 Trip Mine

^8Attributes:
- Strength (1)
- Assemble (1)
- Heal (1)

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]

Often quiet and enigmatic, Weequays can be found throughout the galaxy, from the lower levels of Coruscant to the distant desert flats of Tatooine. They are a humanoid species with coarse, leathery skin and bald heads. By tradition, a Weequay wears a braided topknot on one side of his or her head.  Jabba employed a large collection of Weequay to man his barge."